Being part of a larger network with offices across Southern Africa gives the Heritage Hill Estate office access to a wider pool of listings and buyer or tenant demand than a single independent agency could offer on its own, while still working from local knowledge of the Midstream Estate area. The agency positions its work around helping clients build wealth and financial security through property, whether that means selling a home, finding a rental, or managing an investment property. Buyers, sellers, landlords and tenants in and around Heritage Hill Estate and Midstream can draw on this combination of local presence and network-wide reach.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.just.property/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'just-property-performers-heritage-hill-estate' AND description = 'A Just Property real estate office in Heritage Hill Estate, part of South Africa''s largest rental agency network with over 100 offices across Southern Africa, offering residential, commercial, industrial and agricultural property sales and rentals.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
