As a distributor for JoJo water storage products, K.W. Pompe also stocks water storage tanks and related water filtration, sanitation and water monitoring equipment, extending its range beyond pumps alone into broader water management for rural and residential properties. This combination lets a customer source a pump, a storage tank and the irrigation fittings needed to connect them from a single Wonderboom-based supplier rather than several different outlets. Farmers, smallholders and homeowners across the Pretoria area needing pumping or water storage equipment, or repairs to an existing pump, can draw on this wider product range.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.jojo.co.za/distributor/kw-pompe-pty-ltd/'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'k-w-pompe-pty-ltd-rooiwal' AND description = 'K.W. Pompe stocks and supplies a wide range of pumps, including borehole, booster, drainage, fire-fighting, pond and solar pumps, and offers pump maintenance, repairs, and irrigation system design and supply for gardens and farms.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
